Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Metrics not appearing in Prometheus:

Verify ServiceMonitor is in the correct namespace
Check that VM pods have the correct labels
Ensure Prometheus has permissions to scrape metrics
Grafana dashboard not loading data:

Verify Prometheus data source configuration
Check metric names and labels in queries
Ensure time range is appropriate
Alerts not firing:

Verify PrometheusRule syntax
Check alert thresholds are appropriate
Ensure metrics are being collected
High resource usage on monitoring components:

Adjust scrape intervals
Reduce retention periods
Optimize dashboard queries
Verification Commands
# Check all monitoring components
oc get pods -n openshift-monitoring | grep -E "(prometheus|grafana|alertmanager)"

# Verify VM metrics collection
